# Findings inside NordVPN's own prebuilt binaries (nordvpn/nordvpnd). We can't
# rebuild them; only a new client release fixes these. Remove each entry once
# an upstream bump (.github/workflows/upstream.yml) clears it.

# golang.org/x/net/html DoS, vendored in the NordVPN client (fixed in x/net 0.62.0).
CVE-2026-78661

# golang.org/x/net/http2, vendored in the NordVPN client (fixed in x/net 0.60.0).
CVE-2026-78669

# snapd snap-confine race (2022). Likely a false positive: Trivy compares the
# vendored module's v0.0.0-2026... pseudo-version against snapd's 2.57.6 tag.
CVE-2022-3328
